  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 200°C/180°C fan-forced. Halve potatoes lengthways.\n• Place on the lined oven tray, cut-side down. Drizzle with olive oil and season generously with salt and pepper.\n• Bake until golden and tender, 30-35 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/623bb87ae108fb204166f638/step-0a923c05.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When potatoes have 10 mins remaining, grate carrot. Drain and rinse butter beans.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook 1/2 the carrot until tender, 2-3 mins.\n• Add jerk seasoning, tomato paste and kidney beans and cook until fragrant, 1-2 mins.\n• Stir in the butter and the water and cook until thickened, 2-4 mins. Season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/623bb87ae108fb204166f638/step-9f95d256.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop tomato.\n• In a medium bowl, add a drizzle of red wine vinegar, olive oil and a pinch of salt and pepper.\n• Add tomato, mixed leaves and remaining carrot and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/623bb87ae108fb204166f638/step-e6f1e3fa.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide sweet potato between plates.\n• Top with beans. Sprinkle over shredded cheddar cheese.\n• Serve with salad.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/623bb87ae108fb204166f638/step-0318e4a5.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
